# T3 Chat's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-t3chat-setting-cookie = 您的 t3.chat 浏览器会话。登录 https://t3.chat，打开开发者工具 → Application → Cookies → https://t3.chat，复制所有 Cookie（会话 Cookie 的名称会随版本变化），并作为一条标头粘贴："name=value; name2=value2"。它仅会发送到 t3.chat。

## The report: the overage window and the plan's usage band and
## subscription status. Plan names, the band, and the status stay as T3
## Chat sends them.

usage-t3chat-overage = 超额用量
usage-t3chat-plan = 套餐
usage-t3chat-usage-band = 用量档位
usage-t3chat-subscription = 订阅
